      "updated": 1793346232831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "fork独立agent实例：\nSystem Prompt：继承主agent\n工具挂载：read、edit、write\ndeps_type：挂载AgentDeps\ncapabilities：hooks #on.tool_execute",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "fork独立agent实例：\nSystem Prompt：继承主agent\n工具挂载：read、edit、write\ndeps_type：挂载AgentDeps\ncapabilities：hooks #on.tool_execute",
