      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "track_edit：处理首次出现的：path文件首次修改状态更新+落盘checkpoints.json\n 首次备份    非首次直接返回不处理",
      "fontSize": 19.827469215713172,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "track_edit：处理首次出现的：path文件首次修改状态更新+落盘checkpoints.json\n 首次备份    非首次直接返回不处理",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dz7pGt0AdJ5EQcMX30PFN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2946.9142554088535,
      "y": -3835.4153742736917,
      "width": 799.9990234375,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
